---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="yibble privacy policy">
  <main class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <a href="/" class="text-sm opacity-40 hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity mb-8 inline-block">← vijay.io</a>

    <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold mb-2">privacy policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm opacity-40 mb-12">last updated: april 25, 2026</p>

    <div class="space-y-8 text-[15px] leading-relaxed opacity-75">
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold opacity-100 mb-3">the short version</h2>
        <p>
          yibble runs entirely on your device. no data is collected, no data is transmitted,
          no data is stored anywhere except on your phone. there are no servers, no analytics,
          no tracking, and no ads.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold opacity-100 mb-3">data storage</h2>
        <p>
          all data, including your yibble's personality, memories, conversation history,
          and growth state, is stored locally on your device. this data is never sent
          to any external service.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold opacity-100 mb-3">ai processing</h2>
        <p>
          yibble uses on-device machine learning models for speech recognition,
          language generation, and text-to-speech. all ai processing happens locally
          on your phone. no audio, text, or conversation data is ever transmitted
          to any cloud service.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold opacity-100 mb-3">microphone access</h2>
        <p>
          yibble requests microphone access to listen when you want to talk to it.
          audio is processed in real-time on your device and is never recorded,
          stored, or transmitted. when you stop a conversation, the microphone
          is no longer active.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold opacity-100 mb-3">network access</h2>
        <p>
          yibble does not connect to the internet. all models ship inside the app and
          all processing happens on your device. the app makes no network requests.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold opacity-100 mb-3">children's privacy</h2>
        <p>
          since yibble does not collect any data whatsoever, it is safe for users of all ages.
          no personal information is gathered from any user, including children.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold opacity-100 mb-3">third-party services</h2>
        <p>
          yibble does not integrate with any third-party analytics, advertising,
          or data collection services. it makes no external connections of any kind.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold opacity-100 mb-3">data deletion</h2>
        <p>
          deleting the app removes all data. you can also reset all data from within
          the app's settings. since no data exists outside your device, deletion is
          complete and permanent.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold opacity-100 mb-3">contact</h2>
        <p>
          questions about this policy? reach out at
          <a href="mailto:vijayvmp@gmail.com" class="text-cyan-400 hover:text-cyan-300 transition-colors">vijayvmp@gmail.com</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
